# P1's "necessarily" may be read two ways: as necessity of the whole conditional, or as necessity of what happens.
# That is a matter of where the modal applies, outside the claim foreseen_happens. It is not a word in a shared claim changing sense.
# So I name no bridge, though Boethius's later reply turns on this point.
